          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-YAKH-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You must be the feisty Wizard from afar that everyone's been going on about. Hmm. I thought you'd be taller.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_SorcererF_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LegateShirazi_MIR_01.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254087,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-YAKH-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "All the same. I'm in need of someone who isn't afraid to let their claws come out, so to speak, and you seem perfect. Interested?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_SorcererF_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LegateShirazi_MIR_02.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254087,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-YAKH-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Good. The Bumbai Rebels drive us mad with their cacophonous protestations. Day. Night. Naptime. Second Naptime. They never shut up!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_SorcererF_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LegateShirazi_MIR_03.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254087,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-YAKH-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We civilized Qhats require ample rest if we're to properly manage this place. Quiet those vociferous Bumbai Rebels down so we can sleep!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_SorcererF_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LegateShirazi_MIR_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254087,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
